  "criterion_findings": [
    "Separates adjustment, joint/conditional intervention identification, cross-world conjunctions, bounded response-function models and Bayesian supplied-model queries. Exact frontdoor, positive-law twins, coupling fibers and joint-abduction cases expose distinct lending values and failure meanings.",
    "Thirty unchanged audited source records support concrete implementation behavior, graph/information domains and limits. Four independent references replay. Timeout, unsupported input and precondition errors are not promoted to nonidentification; native qualification and broad coverage remain open."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Scoped comparison does not establish universal ID/IDC or counterfactual capability, theorem completeness for uninspected branches or complete software coverage.",
    "Authored laws, retrospective accounts and prices are hypothetical; bounds are population identified sets, not sampling confidence regions or bank ROI.",
    "No new native engine trial, licensed integration, visual or final acceptance; exact editions, dependencies and rights remain separate."
  ],
